{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object. Move to designated place if heavy. Check properties and do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDesignatedPlace    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNear    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />",
    "BT": {
